00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.020
He's one of the greatest
and most impactful

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.130
statisticians and computer
scientists of our time.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.200
Plus, he grew up in the Soviet Union,

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.860
eventually heading the
Computer Science Department,

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.800
